cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite this software and the original model sources identified in README.md."
type: software
title: "Code and data for Oscillation-relaxation bounds for Markov jump processes"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Kangqiao
    affiliation: "School of Science, Xihua University; Key Laboratory of High Performance Scientific Computation, Xihua University"
  - family-names: Gong
    given-names: Zongping
    affiliation: "Department of Applied Physics, The University of Tokyo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KangqiaoLiu/oscillation-relaxation-bounds"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and source data accompanying Oscillation-relaxation bounds for Markov
  jump processes by Kangqiao Liu and Zongping Gong. The package reproduces
  heterogeneous-ring examples, a six-state network with coupled cycles, and
  the published eight-state wild-type cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance
  regulator (CFTR) kinetic model. It includes an independent increased-precision
  reconstruction of Figure 1, a four-state entropy-production example, and
  sampled-dissipation and heterogeneity-localization calculations for Shiraishi's
  three-layer model. Model inputs, source-data definitions, fixed dependencies,
  reproduction instructions, and original model attributions are provided.
  The code is licensed under MIT; the data and figures are licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.
keywords:
  - stochastic thermodynamics
  - Markov jump processes
  - oscillation-relaxation bounds
  - entropy production
  - eigenmodes
